      en: ["About 75,000 inhabitants in North Al Batinah", "Northernmost wilayat on the border with the Emirates", "About 280 kilometers northwest of Muscat", "Khor Liwa and Khor Shinas mangrove protected areas", "Protected areas were designated in 2008", "19th-century Shinas Fort", "Ferry connection to Iranian Bandar-e Lengeh", "Nesting place for migratory birds in the mangrove forest"]
